{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07626","headline":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴 · 王翰","name":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未极人心畅，如何帝道明。\n仍嫌酺宴促，复宠乐游行。\n陆海披珍藏，天河直斗城。\n四关青霭合，数处白云生。\n饪餗调元气，歌钟溢雅声。\n空惭尧舜日，至德杳难名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}